{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lady of Midland is gone, and with her, your memories. As her successor, you shall rule in her place \u2013 if you can only disguise your amnesia and please your demonic patron. For death is not the price of your failure or disobedience. There are far worse fates for errant souls.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Demon Kingdom, you will rule a dark fantasy realm where demonic pacts empower nations. Your own patron has her own dark desires. Obey her, solve Midland\u2019s mysteries, and balance the demands of your realm \u2013 your very soul depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRule by swiping left or right to guide Midland towards glory or ruination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860130/extras/39d6a0826972a99e30b159e4c8d92943.poster.avif?t=1762956700\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860130/extras/39d6a0826972a99e30b159e4c8d92943.webm?t=1762956700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860130/extras/39d6a0826972a99e30b159e4c8d92943.mp4?t=1762956700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tHundreds of unique events ensuring no playthrough will be exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tDiplomacy with your neighbour states will shape peace and trade in Midland</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tA deep dark fantasy mystery to unravel unfolding according to your prior decisions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tMultiple endings for the fate of Midland and your very soul</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/imag